*Heading
Newton-Raphson convergence: simple shear ramp of one UEL cube, OPEN system (mu prescribed at INITMU on all nodes)
** Top face (y = 1) displaced in x by GAMMA; top u_y and the z = 1 face free (traction-free normal
** deformation: Poynting stresses and swelling are solved for); bottom fixed in x, y; z = 0 face symmetric.
** Unknowns: u_y of the top nodes, u_z of the z = 1 nodes (mu prescribed: drained bulk terms in Kuu are tested).
** Properties: properties.inp (final2_B1, 28 entries); uel.f90 compiled with FACTOR = 3 (NSDV = 196).
*Preprint, echo=NO, model=NO, history=NO, contact=NO
